{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_003mik_title", "source_sha256": "64514c597d84881b6bfa12ba7e80eeeee7155821177df4e0bbf34115310ea530", "ja": "「君と出会ってから」星井美希", "zh": "“自从与你相遇” 星井美希", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_003mik_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9bdc019c7d550aba672f94e32c8bc63cac4e6ff785f109dafceefb647c29402c", "ja": "Destiny公演を前に、\n美希とプロデューサーが出会った頃からの\nことを振り返る一幕です。", "zh": "这是在Destiny公演前，\n回顾美希与制作人从相遇之时起\n一路走来的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_003mik_1000_003mik", "source_sha256": "b3c066e16766b8d18d1e7056df62197fc029a3b0b400b5f0566131a57a5f38ce", "ja": "ねえ、つめてくれる？\nミキもそのベンチ、座りたいから。", "zh": "喂，能往旁边挪挪吗？\n因为美希也想坐那张长椅。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_003mik_1001_p", "source_sha256": "de40a9c295a13907336910cab371e70b5f34868a35f24e18c649e67242c06dcf", "ja": "うわっ。えっと～、君、カップルにヤボなこと\n言ってないで……。ちょっとこっちへ。", "zh": "哇啊。那个～，你别去跟情侣\n说这种不识趣的话了……稍微过来一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_003mik_1002_003mik", "source_sha256": "e1530c5bc0da32819dad4b7701174fa597392430cb0950e620648adc47199eca", "ja": "？　……誰？", "zh": "？……谁？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_003mik_1003_p", "source_sha256": "3f33cfb14a7cd4d4f16d5be5401a8a26f018ca4431b3b880e4d1fe89a909da7a", "ja": "俺はさっき決まった、君のプロデューサーだよ。\n君を迎えに来たんだ。", "zh": "我是刚刚决定下来的，你的制作人。\n我是来接你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_003mik_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "7a746cf8703174a781545ac08613173edae8f567b25cfbc39d8b763e6d3db712", "ja": "プロデューサーの……、人？\nよくわからないけど、それって、なにする人？", "zh": "制作人的……人？\n我不太明白，那是做什么的人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_003mik_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "f1379a56ea440196b3f4786ce5c3e436839d68642fd56c2be5d9ed082710998b", "ja": "ねえ、あのー……、そこの人。", "zh": "喂，那边的……那个人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_003mik_1006_p", "source_sha256": "593343789e90f187c882e1921a34b3178d4e773037af0819c8d8632d677daba6", "ja": "そこの人じゃなくて、プロデューサーだってば。\nなにか用か？　美希。", "zh": "不是“那边那个人”，是制作人啦。\n有什么事吗，美希？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_003mik_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "2f0d9fe3adb9981644c68c7aa5a1548c42254d1e3ce24cb4b6ac77f7a6cfae2f", "ja": "アイドルについて、聞こうと思って。見た目が\nかわいければ、あとはどうでもいいんでしょ？", "zh": "我想问问关于偶像的事。只要长得可爱，其他的都无所谓，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_003mik_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "455a354c08625b9587899cfcd1f41f846a73706c28e09f9a56bf43892ad517dd", "ja": "ここにはね、ミキがすごいなーって思ってる\n先生がいるの。だから、会いにきたの。", "zh": "这里有一位让美希觉得很厉害的老师。所以，我是来见他的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_003mik_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "0120e2f878b91b60de5f0b40b207ffc33c48639953aecd3585735ef1b88853f2", "ja": "ほらほら！　先生、あそこに浮いてるよっ。", "zh": "看那边看那边！老师，有东西飘在那边哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_003mik_1010_p", "source_sha256": "11164a8858808c313d11190252f786f91c0d31baca2a4a131a98516bfe851b6d", "ja": "浮いてる？　……あ！　あれはカモじゃないか。\nじゃあ、先生ってのは……。", "zh": "漂浮？……啊！那不是只水鸭吗？\n那么，所谓的老师是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_003mik_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "93fe9998cabdbd752b5506e1599d2fb5fb3930daa763668661456cc323214f9f", "ja": "すごいよね。寝たまんまでも、プカプカ浮ける\nんだから。あんな風になんにもしないで……。", "zh": "真厉害啊。就算睡着了，也能漂浮着。像那样什么都不做……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_003mik_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "08b3cf7dab782405c67877439a17c9a88f6db41c689baaae52be7a7b8f11d516", "ja": "トップまで、浮かんでいけたらいいな。\nがんばらないよう、がんばらないと。", "zh": "要是能一直漂浮到最顶端就好了。\n得努力做到不努力才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_003mik_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "4331a46975c7243ea7701e5e117ad83238d0106388ab9341f922c9cc072e6e9e", "ja": "んんっ……むにゃ……あふぅ……、あれ？\nここ、劇場……？　そっか、今のは……。", "zh": "嗯……唔嗯……啊呜……咦？\n这里是剧场……？这样啊，刚才那是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_003mik_1014_p", "source_sha256": "60b01f04d0300f137b243793b9f76549f4d1cee064a2188a312109c306c97638", "ja": "やっと起きたか、美希。\n今日はまた、特に気持ちよさそうに寝てたな。", "zh": "终于醒了啊，美希。\n今天你又睡得特别香呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_003mik_1015_003mik", "source_sha256": "9ca29bdd8375a844101d2009ef69c02f4cdfd9606acb2a82eee8ba62cbc9dc5a", "ja": "あ、そこの人。", "zh": "啊，那边那个人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_003mik_1016_p", "source_sha256": "de7bed593d4de84106ed962347eb6e3c73725a798cd83dfd7fad4e3418b203b1", "ja": "そこの人じゃなくて、プロデューサーだってば。\nまだ目が覚めないのか？　美希。", "zh": "别叫我“那边的人”，都说了我是制作人。\n还没睡醒吗？美希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_003mik_1017_003mik", "source_sha256": "d49bea6e20d4ae123b6d39ef213c52992f1eae5999d599e2baa0c009734c9e52", "ja": "あはっ、そうなのかも。\n……ねえ、{$P$}。", "zh": "啊哈，说不定真是这样。\n……呐，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_003mik_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "e356ac24855a4645c89a3c797487de98aa5d383d5113f372e41c2262bd56e377", "ja": "ミキ、がんばらないようにがんばってたのに、\nあんまりがんばれなかった気がするの。", "zh": "美希明明一直在努力不去努力，却感觉自己好像没怎么努力起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_003mik_1019_p", "source_sha256": "d0da50a75111a917c7e47e6cabae65269b125c76970a5078e30cc2d00fc5407c", "ja": "えーと……つまり、頑張ってしまったってことかな。\nうん、頑張ってくれたと思う。", "zh": "呃……也就是说，你还是努力了吧。\n嗯，我觉得你已经努力过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_003mik_1020_003mik", "source_sha256": "6d085c2fb3cb285ce26edcfb1e525a6a0daea0bd4eeb6886f83ee00546432eb7", "ja": "やっぱり、そうだよね。\nどうしてか、わかる？", "zh": "果然是这样对吧。\n你知道是为什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_003mik_1021_p", "source_sha256": "f15aa8dff0d6b8ed0087d6d1293ec39a318b3eabd78a49d99e65cd60b5c3d21d", "ja": "どうしてかな。アイドルが好きになった……\nだけじゃ、ないよな？", "zh": "为什么呢。应该不只是因为……喜欢上偶像了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_003mik_1022_003mik", "source_sha256": "524790f2f054495cbe1b43fa270fb0a17d6b745b03ef31a7466410723c7a9e64", "ja": "うん。好きになったけど、\nアイドルだけじゃないって思うな。", "zh": "嗯。虽然确实喜欢上了，\n但美希觉得不仅是偶像哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_003mik_1023_003mik", "source_sha256": "2f7f3b4b5b046d9ae1a3f3c0eb8df8b89ef2c79d5d8f422a1b79f4e6534c1d96", "ja": "ミキが好きになったのは～……。\nいってもいーい？", "zh": "美希喜欢上的是～……。说出来可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_003mik_1024_p", "source_sha256": "27041bb861232a2bdb225ef220ff278148e1ef02029d53c2f73a046406e14831", "ja": "ど、どうだろう。聞いたらマズそう……\nいや、そうでもないか。", "zh": "这、这可不好说。听了好像不太妙……\n不，也不一定。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_003mik_1025_p", "source_sha256": "7b9947d70a900c7c7808138b9bd3a96c31b2f7df2017de66fbae5c41586155be", "ja": "たぶん今の美希は、いろいろなことが\n好きになってるはずだから。", "zh": "现在的美希，大概已经喜欢上很多东西了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_003mik_1026_003mik", "source_sha256": "7f1b6ee427f39ac9f883dbcec54575199b86534cb08041611190393cc8219e49", "ja": "うん♪　ミキね、いろいろ好きになったみたい。\n{$P$}が見せてくれた物、いろいろ。", "zh": "嗯♪ 美希好像喜欢上了好多东西。\n都是{$P$}让我看到的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_003mik_1027_003mik", "source_sha256": "d98aa17ea4b0504591748fcdc672945debfe90aed2199e123df3e44537943605", "ja": "いろいろ好きになって、やりたくて、なりたくて。\nだから、いろいろがんばっちゃってるカンジ！", "zh": "喜欢上了各种各样的事物，想做，也想成为。\n所以，感觉自己在各种方面都超级努力呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_003mik_1028_p", "source_sha256": "2ee2d4c2536020562efb6d6ec4dab3e2820093bcf615ee30d72e0871f2acc02d", "ja": "そうだよな。でも、美希が好きになりそうなことは、\nこれからもたくさん見せると思う。", "zh": "是啊。不过，我想今后还会让美希看到很多可能会喜欢的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_003mik_1029_p", "source_sha256": "62a902fbd76e31f8f37fa95ae20a878fc71e7614319ffc6da7ee976a63243a60", "ja": "たとえば、次のDestiny公演での景色とか。\n……ちゃんと準備してるか？", "zh": "比如下一场Destiny公演的景色之类的。\n……你准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_003mik_1030_003mik", "source_sha256": "c6fea1bd2fdcc142d4f535e7134b1ac1623d56a79c930f1976b5252143071278", "ja": "もちろんなの！　ミキ、好きなことはいくらでも\nがんばれちゃうから。それにー。", "zh": "当然啦！美希喜欢的事情，无论多少都能努力下去。再说——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_003mik_1031_003mik", "source_sha256": "f4c8dfe173d09362ed9e0804787ecf67b47e67ec4ec4ba0b82382d5677864894", "ja": "何を好きになっても、一番の好きは、ミキ、\nもう変わらないから。……ね、ハニー♪　あはっ☆", "zh": "不管喜欢上什么，最喜欢的那个，永远都是美希，不会改变。……对吧，亲爱的♪ 啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
